<title>USA: Sipex Corp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Sipex Corp sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass., l 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>SIPEX Corp said Thursday its directors approved a two-for-one common stock split payable in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>All shareholders of record at the close of business on August 18, 1997 will receive one additional share for each share owned.</p>
<p>The additional shares will be distributed to shareholders on or about August 27, 1997.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the stock split, SIPEX will have approximately 17,406,928 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
